#: Settings.ui:858
msgid ""
"Choose which monitor owns the primary dock. Additional monitors can show "
"secondary docks."
msgstr ""
"Pilih monitor mana yang memiliki dok utama. Monitor tambahan dapat "
"menampilkan dok sekunder."

#: Settings.ui:869
msgid ""
"Hide the dock instead of moving it to another monitor when its preferred "
"monitor is disconnected."
msgstr ""
"Sembunyikan dok alih-alih memindahkannya ke monitor lain saat monitor "
"pilihannya terputus."

#: Settings.ui:916
msgid "Place the dock along the left edge of the screen."
msgstr "Tempatkan dok di sepanjang tepi kiri layar."

#: Settings.ui:926
msgid "Place the dock along the bottom edge of the screen."
msgstr "Tempatkan dok di sepanjang tepi bawah layar."

#: Settings.ui:936
msgid "Place the dock along the top edge of the screen."
msgstr "Tempatkan dok di sepanjang tepi atas layar."

#: Settings.ui:947
msgid "Place the dock along the right edge of the screen."
msgstr "Tempatkan dok di sepanjang tepi kanan layar."

#: Settings.ui:1025
msgid "Open advanced intelligent autohide settings."
msgstr "Buka pengaturan sembunyikan otomatis cerdas tingkat lanjut."

#: Settings.ui:1042
msgid "Hide the dock automatically when it would obstruct a window."
msgstr "Sembunyikan dok secara otomatis jika menghalangi jendela."

#: Settings.ui:1098
msgid "Set the maximum dock size relative to available screen space."
msgstr "Atur ukuran dok maksimum relatif terhadap ruang layar yang tersedia."

#: Settings.ui:1109
msgid ""
"Make the dock span the full screen edge instead of fitting its contents."
msgstr "Jadikan dok menjangkau tepi layar penuh alih-alih menyesuaikan isinya."

#: Settings.ui:1122
msgid "Keep dock icons centered instead of placing them from the edge."
msgstr ""
"Jaga agar ikon dok tetap berada di tengah alih-alih menempatkannya di tepi."

#: Settings.ui:1159
msgid "Set the gap between the dock and the screen edge."
msgstr "Atur jarak antara dok dan tepi layar."

#: Settings.ui:1201
msgid "Set extra spacing between the pointer edge and the dock reveal area."
msgstr "Atur jarak ekstra antara tepi penunjuk dan area pengungkapan dok."

#: Settings.ui:1242
msgid "Set the maximum application icon size."
msgstr "Atur ukuran ikon aplikasi maksimum."

#: Settings.ui:1257
msgid ""
"Keep icon size fixed and scroll the dock when more icons exist than fit."
msgstr ""
"Pertahankan ukuran ikon tetap dan gulir dok ketika ada lebih banyak ikon "
"daripada yang sesuai."

#: Settings.ui:1297
msgid "Scale the size of window preview thumbnails."
msgstr "Skala ukuran thumbnail pratinjau jendela."

#: Settings.ui:1338
msgid "Set the width of the edge area used for dock dwell activation."
msgstr "Atur lebar area tepi yang digunakan untuk aktivasi dock diam."

#: Settings.ui:1372
msgid "Set how often the dock checks for edge dwell activation."
msgstr "Atur seberapa sering dok memeriksa aktivasi edge live."

#: Settings.ui:1406
msgid "Set how long pointer pressure must be held before the dock appears."
msgstr "Atur berapa lama tekanan penunjuk harus ditahan sebelum dock muncul."

#: Settings.ui:1464
msgid "Show applications pinned to the dock."
msgstr "Tampilkan aplikasi yang disematkan ke dok."

#: Settings.ui:1487
msgid ""
"With multiple monitors, show pinned applications only on the primary-monitor "
"dock."
msgstr ""
"Dengan beberapa monitor, tampilkan aplikasi yang disematkan hanya pada dok "
"monitor utama."

#: Settings.ui:1514
msgid "Show applications with open windows."
msgstr "Tampilkan aplikasi dengan jendela terbuka."

#: Settings.ui:1537
msgid "Show an application only when it has windows on the current workspace."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan aplikasi hanya jika aplikasi tersebut memiliki jendela di ruang "
"kerja saat ini."

#: Settings.ui:1551
msgid ""
"Keep applications with urgent windows visible even when those windows are on "
"another workspace."
msgstr ""
"Jaga agar aplikasi dengan jendela mendesak tetap terlihat meskipun jendela "
"tersebut berada di ruang kerja lain."

#: Settings.ui:1565
msgid ""
"Show an application only on docks belonging to monitors where it has windows."
msgstr "Tampilkan aplikasi hanya di dok milik monitor yang memiliki jendela."

#: Settings.ui:1580
msgid ""
"Show a preview menu when hovering over an application with multiple windows."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan menu pratinjau saat mengarahkan kursor ke aplikasi dengan banyak "
"jendela."

#: Settings.ui:1592
msgid ""
"Show each open window as a separate icon instead of grouping windows by "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan setiap jendela yang terbuka sebagai ikon terpisah alih-alih "
"mengelompokkan jendela berdasarkan aplikasi."

#: Settings.ui:1618
msgid "Keep the focused application visible while the dock scrolls."
msgstr "Jaga agar aplikasi yang terfokus tetap terlihat saat dok bergulir."

#: Settings.ui:1661
msgid ""
"Choose whether running icons follow dock order or their window positions."
msgstr ""
"Pilih apakah ikon yang berjalan mengikuti urutan dok atau posisi jendelanya."

#: Settings.ui:1687
msgid "Show the Applications button in the dock."
msgstr "Tampilkan tombol Aplikasi di dok."

#: Settings.ui:1728
msgid "Place the Applications button before other dock items."
msgstr "Tempatkan tombol Aplikasi sebelum item dok lainnya."

#: Settings.ui:1741
msgid "Animate the Applications button when opening the overview."
msgstr "Menganimasikan tombol Aplikasi saat membuka ikhtisar."

#: Settings.ui:1763
msgid "Keep the Applications button at a dock edge when Panel mode is enabled."
msgstr "Simpan tombol Aplikasi di tepi dok saat mode Panel diaktifkan."

#: Settings.ui:1801
msgid "Show the Trash icon in the dock."
msgstr "Tampilkan ikon Sampah di dok."

#: Settings.ui:1839
msgid "Show mounted volumes and removable devices in the dock."
msgstr "Tampilkan volume terpasang dan perangkat yang dapat dilepas di dok."

#: Settings.ui:1862
msgid "Hide devices that are available but not currently mounted."
msgstr "Sembunyikan perangkat yang tersedia tetapi saat ini belum terpasang."

#: Settings.ui:1876
msgid "Include network locations in the volumes list."
msgstr "Sertakan lokasi jaringan dalam daftar volume."

#: Settings.ui:1905
msgid ""
"Keep volume, device, and Trash windows separate from normal file-manager "
"windows."
msgstr ""
"Pisahkan jendela volume, perangkat, dan Sampah dari jendela pengelola file "
"normal."

#: Settings.ui:1943
msgid "Animate icons when applications request attention."
msgstr "Menganimasikan ikon ketika aplikasi meminta perhatian."

#: Settings.ui:1981
msgid "Bounce icons when an application launches or needs attention."
msgstr "Pantulkan ikon saat aplikasi diluncurkan atau memerlukan perhatian."

#: Settings.ui:2019
msgid "Disable application name tooltips when hovering over dock icons."
msgstr ""
"Nonaktifkan tooltips nama aplikasi saat mengarahkan kursor ke ikon dok."

#: Settings.ui:2057
msgid "Set the maximum width of application name tooltips."
msgstr "Tetapkan lebar maksimum tooltips nama aplikasi."

#: Settings.ui:2097
msgid "Open window previews when the pointer rests on an application icon."
msgstr "Buka pratinjau jendela saat penunjuk berada pada ikon aplikasi."

#: Settings.ui:2155
msgid "Choose the animation used when window previews open and close."
msgstr ""
"Pilih animasi yang digunakan saat pratinjau jendela membuka dan menutup."

#: Settings.ui:2188
msgid "Limit the height of the window preview list."
msgstr "Batasi ketinggian daftar pratinjau jendela."

#: Settings.ui:2222
msgid "Set how long preview open and close animations take."
msgstr ""
"Menyetel berapa lama waktu yang dibutuhkan animasi buka dan tutup pratinjau."

#: Settings.ui:2256
msgid "Set how long the pointer must hover before previews open."
msgstr "Atur berapa lama penunjuk harus melayang sebelum pratinjau dibuka."

#: Settings.ui:2290
msgid "Set how long previews remain open after the pointer leaves."
msgstr "Atur berapa lama pratinjau tetap terbuka setelah penunjuk keluar."

#: Settings.ui:2324
msgid "Set the opacity of other windows during preview peek."
msgstr "Atur opacity jendela lain selama pratinjau mengintip."

#: Settings.ui:2358
msgid "Set how long preview peek remains active."
msgstr "Atur berapa lama cuplikan pratinjau tetap aktif."

#: Settings.ui:2453
msgid "Configure the Super plus number shortcut behavior."
msgstr "Konfigurasikan perilaku pintasan nomor Super plus."

#: Settings.ui:2470
msgid "Enable Super plus number shortcuts for dock applications."
msgstr "Aktifkan pintasan nomor Super plus untuk aplikasi dok."

#: Settings.ui:2549
msgid "Configure the middle-click action."
msgstr "Konfigurasikan tindakan klik tengah."

#: Settings.ui:2565
msgid ""
"Choose what a primary click does when an application is already running."
msgstr "Pilih apa yang dilakukan klik utama saat aplikasi sudah berjalan."

#: Settings.ui:2671
msgid "Choose what scrolling over an application icon does."
msgstr "Pilih fungsi menggulir ikon aplikasi."

#: Settings.ui:2711
msgid "Set how often XDock checks whether the dock overlaps a window."
msgstr ""
"Atur seberapa sering XDock memeriksa apakah dok tumpang tindih dengan "
"jendela."

#: Settings.ui:2745
msgid "Minimum delay between scroll events that cycle application windows."
msgstr ""
"Penundaan minimum antara peristiwa gulir yang memutar jendela aplikasi."

#: Settings.ui:2779
msgid "Prevent repeated workspace switches during rapid scrolling."
msgstr "Cegah peralihan ruang kerja berulang kali selama pengguliran cepat."

#: Settings.ui:2813
msgid "Time the pointer must hold an icon before rearranging mode starts."
msgstr "Waktu penunjuk harus menahan ikon sebelum mode penataan ulang dimulai."

#: Settings.ui:2847
msgid ""
"Remember the last window selected when cycling through an application's "
"windows."
msgstr "Ingat jendela terakhir yang dipilih saat menelusuri jendela aplikasi."

#: Settings.ui:2909
msgid "Choose the overall visual style of the dock."
msgstr "Pilih gaya visual keseluruhan dok."

#: Settings.ui:2944
msgid "Set the opacity of the shelf gradient at its top edge."
msgstr "Atur opacity gradien rak di tepi atasnya."

#: Settings.ui:2978
msgid "Set the opacity of the shelf gradient at its bottom edge."
msgstr "Atur opacity gradien rak di tepi bawahnya."

#: Settings.ui:3012
msgid "Set the opacity of the highlight drawn on the dock shelf."
msgstr "Atur opacity dari sorotan yang digambar di rak dok."

#: Settings.ui:3046
msgid "Set the opacity of the dock shelf border."
msgstr "Atur opacity batas rak dok."

#: Settings.ui:3080
msgid "Set the angle of the dock shelf gradient."
msgstr "Atur sudut gradien rak dok."

#: Settings.ui:3114
msgid "Set the height of the dock shelf."
msgstr "Atur ketinggian rak dok."

#: Settings.ui:3148
msgid "Show a reflection effect beneath the dock shelf."
msgstr "Tampilkan efek refleksi di bawah rak dermaga."

#: Settings.ui:3176
msgid "Set the opacity of the shelf reflection."
msgstr "Atur opacity refleksi rak."

#: Settings.ui:3210
msgid "Choose the color at the top of the shelf gradient."
msgstr "Pilih warna di bagian atas gradien rak."

#: Settings.ui:3239
msgid "Choose the color at the bottom of the shelf gradient."
msgstr "Pilih warna di bagian bawah gradien rak."

#: Settings.ui:3268
msgid "Choose the shelf highlight color."
msgstr "Pilih warna highlight rak."

#: Settings.ui:3297
msgid "Choose the shelf shadow color."
msgstr "Pilih warna bayangan rak."

#: Settings.ui:3326
msgid "Set the opacity of the shelf shadow."
msgstr "Atur opacity bayangan rak."

#: Settings.ui:3360
msgid "Set the width of the shelf highlight."
msgstr "Atur lebar sorotan rak."

#: Settings.ui:3394
msgid "Set the width of the shelf shadow."
msgstr "Atur lebar bayangan rak."

#: Settings.ui:3429
msgid "Choose the dock border color."
msgstr "Pilih warna batas dok."

#: Settings.ui:3458
msgid "Set the dock border width."
msgstr "Atur lebar batas dok."

#: Settings.ui:3487
msgid "Show a shadow around the dock."
msgstr "Tampilkan bayangan di sekitar dermaga."

#: Settings.ui:3515
msgid "Choose the dock box shadow color."
msgstr "Pilih warna bayangan kotak dok."

#: Settings.ui:3544
msgid "Set how far the dock shadow spreads."
msgstr "Atur seberapa jauh bayangan dermaga menyebar."

#: Settings.ui:3573
msgid "Set how softly the dock shadow is blurred."
msgstr "Atur seberapa lembut bayangan dok menjadi kabur."

#: Settings.ui:3603
msgid "Choose the translucent glass tint color."
msgstr "Pilih warna kaca bening."

#: Settings.ui:3632
msgid "Set the opacity of the glass tint."
msgstr "Atur opacity warna kaca."

#: Settings.ui:3667
msgid "Choose the floating dock shadow color."
msgstr "Pilih warna bayangan dermaga mengambang."

#: Settings.ui:3696
msgid "Set how far the floating shadow spreads."
msgstr "Atur seberapa jauh penyebaran bayangan mengambang."

#: Settings.ui:3725
msgid "Set how softly the floating shadow is blurred."
msgstr "Atur seberapa lembut bayangan mengambang menjadi kabur."

#: Settings.ui:3755
msgid "Set the inner padding between dock content and its border."
msgstr "Atur padding bagian dalam antara konten dok dan batasnya."

#: Settings.ui:3784
msgid "Choose the separator color between dock sections."
msgstr "Pilih warna pemisah antar bagian dok."

#: Settings.ui:3813
msgid "Set the thickness of dock separators."
msgstr "Atur ketebalan pemisah dok."

#: Settings.ui:3866
msgid "Reduce dock padding and corner radius to save screen space."
msgstr "Kurangi bantalan dok dan radius sudut untuk menghemat ruang layar."

#: Settings.ui:3932
msgid "Disable rounded corners for the dock."
msgstr "Nonaktifkan sudut membulat untuk dok."

#: Settings.ui:3961
msgid "Set the dock corner radius. Use the default value to follow the theme."
msgstr "Atur radius sudut dok. Gunakan nilai default untuk mengikuti tema."

#: Settings.ui:4001
msgid "Open the GNOME overview when the session starts."
msgstr "Buka ikhtisar GNOME saat sesi dimulai."

#: Settings.ui:4027
msgid "Set the radius of the shelf top corners."
msgstr "Atur radius sudut atas rak."

#: Settings.ui:4061
msgid "Set the radius of the shelf bottom corners."
msgstr "Atur radius sudut bawah rak."

#: Settings.ui:4095
msgid "Set the size of the dock reflection."
msgstr "Atur ukuran pantulan dok."

#: Settings.ui:4129
msgid "Set the width of application progress arcs."
msgstr "Atur lebar busur kemajuan aplikasi."

#: Settings.ui:4163
msgid "Set the size of shortcut number labels shown on icons."
msgstr "Atur ukuran label nomor pintasan yang ditampilkan pada ikon."

#: Settings.ui:4197
msgid "Set the maximum width of dock tooltips."
msgstr "Atur lebar maksimum tooltip dock."

#: Settings.ui:4288
msgid ""
"Use XDock's integrated theme defaults instead of the custom appearance "
"controls below."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan default tema terintegrasi XDock alih-alih kontrol tampilan khusus di "
"bawah."

#: Settings.ui:4333
msgid "Open advanced running indicator settings."
msgstr "Buka pengaturan indikator lari lanjutan."

#: Settings.ui:4351
msgid "Choose how running applications are marked on the dock."
msgstr "Pilih bagaimana aplikasi yang berjalan ditandai di dok."

#: Settings.ui:4429
msgid "Choose the custom dock background color."
msgstr "Pilih warna latar belakang dok khusus."

#: Settings.ui:4438
msgid "Enable a custom dock background color."
msgstr "Aktifkan warna latar belakang dok khusus."

#: Settings.ui:4503
msgid "Open advanced opacity settings for dock states."
msgstr "Buka pengaturan opasitas lanjutan untuk status dok."

#: Settings.ui:4520
msgid "Choose which dock opacity state to edit."
msgstr "Pilih status opasitas dok mana yang akan diedit."

#: Settings.ui:4555
msgid "Set the opacity for the selected dock state."
msgstr "Atur opacity untuk status dock yang dipilih."

#: Settings.ui:4628
msgid "Derive dock colors from the current desktop wallpaper."
msgstr "Dapatkan warna dok dari wallpaper desktop saat ini."

#: Settings.ui:4657
msgid "Adjust how strongly wallpaper colors affect the dock."
msgstr "Sesuaikan seberapa kuat pengaruh warna wallpaper terhadap dok."

#: Settings.ui:4722
msgid "Show notification badges and emblems on application icons."
msgstr "Tampilkan lencana dan lambang pemberitahuan pada ikon aplikasi."

#: Settings.ui:4733
msgid "Show notification counts on application icons."
msgstr "Tampilkan jumlah notifikasi pada ikon aplikasi."

#: Settings.ui:4745
msgid "Allow per-application notification count overrides."
msgstr "Izinkan penggantian jumlah notifikasi per aplikasi."

#: Settings.ui:4757
msgid "Clear an application's notification count when it receives focus."
msgstr "Hapus jumlah notifikasi aplikasi saat menerima fokus."

#: Settings.ui:4769
msgid "Show task progress indicators on application icons."
msgstr "Tampilkan indikator kemajuan tugas pada ikon aplikasi."

#: Settings.ui:4792
msgid "Choose the visual style of task progress indicators."
msgstr "Pilih gaya visual indikator kemajuan tugas."

#: Settings.ui:4877
msgid "Enlarge dock icons while the pointer is over them."
msgstr "Perbesar ikon dok saat penunjuk berada di atasnya."

#: Settings.ui:4906
msgid "Set the maximum size of an icon during hover magnification."
msgstr "Tetapkan ukuran maksimum ikon selama pembesaran hover."

#: Settings.ui:4938
msgid "Highlight the icon currently under the pointer during magnification."
msgstr "Sorot ikon yang saat ini berada di bawah penunjuk selama pembesaran."

#: Settings.ui:4966
msgid ""
"Magnify non-application dock items such as the trash and applications button."
msgstr "Memperbesar item dok non-aplikasi seperti tombol sampah dan aplikasi."

#: Settings.ui:4994
msgid "Use spring physics for dock movement and icon animations."
msgstr "Gunakan fisika pegas untuk pergerakan dermaga dan animasi ikon."

#: Settings.ui:5022
msgid "Allow dragging icons to rearrange them in the dock."
msgstr "Izinkan menyeret ikon untuk mengatur ulang ikon di dok."

#: Settings.ui:5050
msgid ""
"Use live window thumbnails for application icons instead of static icons."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan thumbnail jendela langsung untuk ikon aplikasi, bukan ikon statis."

#: Settings.ui:5079
msgid "Set how strongly spring animations pull toward their target."
msgstr "Tetapkan seberapa kuat animasi pegas mencapai targetnya."

#: Settings.ui:5113
msgid "Set how quickly spring animation movement settles."
msgstr "Mengatur seberapa cepat gerakan animasi pegas diselesaikan."

#: Settings.ui:5147
msgid "Set how many neighboring icons are affected by magnification."
msgstr "Atur berapa banyak ikon tetangga yang terpengaruh oleh pembesaran."

#: Settings.ui:5181
msgid "Set how quickly magnification transitions complete."
msgstr "Atur seberapa cepat transisi pembesaran selesai."

#: Settings.ui:5215
msgid "Set the duration of the dock startup animation."
msgstr "Atur durasi animasi pengaktifan dok."

#: Settings.ui:5249
msgid "Set the duration of application launch animations."
msgstr "Atur durasi animasi peluncuran aplikasi."

#: Settings.ui:5283
msgid "Set how far spring animations overshoot their target."
msgstr "Tetapkan seberapa jauh animasi pegas melampaui targetnya."

#: Settings.ui:5346
msgid "Enable the dock command palette for quick actions."
msgstr "Aktifkan palet perintah dok untuk tindakan cepat."

#: Settings.ui:5374
msgid "Show a workspace overview minimap in the dock."
msgstr "Tampilkan minimap ikhtisar ruang kerja di dok."

#: Settings.ui:5402
msgid "Choose which side of the dock contains the workspace minimap."
msgstr "Pilih sisi dok mana yang berisi peta mini ruang kerja."

#: Settings.ui:5434
msgid ""
"Open window previews automatically when an application icon is activated."
msgstr ""
"Buka pratinjau jendela secara otomatis ketika ikon aplikasi diaktifkan."

#: Settings.ui:5462
msgid "Focus a window when its preview is hovered during a drag."
msgstr "Fokuskan jendela saat pratinjaunya diarahkan selama drag."

#: Settings.ui:5490
msgid "Show recent files in application menus opened from the dock."
msgstr "Tampilkan file terbaru di menu aplikasi yang dibuka dari dock."

#: Settings.ui:5518
msgid "Show pinned terminal commands in the dock."
msgstr "Tampilkan perintah terminal yang disematkan di dok."

#: Settings.ui:5546
msgid "Enable window tiling actions from the dock."
msgstr "Aktifkan tindakan penataan jendela dari dok."

#: Settings.ui:5574
msgid "Show docks on secondary monitors with running applications."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan dok pada monitor sekunder dengan aplikasi yang sedang berjalan."

#: Settings.ui:5602
msgid "Choose where secondary-monitor docks appear."
msgstr "Pilih di mana dok monitor sekunder muncul."

#: Settings.ui:5666
msgid "Show media playback controls in application menus."
msgstr "Tampilkan kontrol pemutaran media di menu aplikasi."

#: Settings.ui:5694
msgid "Show per-application volume controls in application menus."
msgstr "Tampilkan kontrol volume per aplikasi di menu aplikasi."

#: Settings.ui:5722
msgid "Show an indicator when the screen is being recorded or shared."
msgstr "Tampilkan indikator saat layar sedang direkam atau dibagikan."

#: Settings.ui:5750
msgid "Show a quick settings panel from the dock."
msgstr "Tampilkan panel pengaturan cepat dari dok."

#: Settings.ui:5809
msgid "Choose the active saved settings profile."
msgstr "Pilih profil pengaturan tersimpan yang aktif."

#: Settings.ui:5831
msgid "Save current settings as a profile."
msgstr "Simpan pengaturan saat ini sebagai profil."

#: Settings.ui:5838
msgid "Delete the selected saved profile."
msgstr "Hapus profil tersimpan yang dipilih."

#: Settings.ui:5925
msgid "Open the XDock project webpage."
msgstr "Buka halaman web proyek XDock."

